re_item_assets/steam/apps/2795060/extras/ab14431effc002f98c396e7b9597bb35.webm?t=1754268594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>The save system allows you to freely explore different story branches and outcomes. Every decision you make leads to a unique adventure!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Exploration</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795060/extras/b76aab0ccde134a6572e61fa185cdc41.poster.avif?t=1754268594\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795060/extras/b76aab0ccde134a6572e61fa185cdc41.webm?t=1754268594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Choose from preinstalled starting prompts or create your own! Share and download prompts via <strong>Steam Workshop</strong>. Whether you're surviving a zombie apocalypse or exploring an alien planet, the possibilities are limitless.<br><br><br><br><br><i>Note: The cloud AI services that power this game have ongoing operating costs. Your purchase of the game covers these costs up to the amount you paid for the game. Beyond that, to manage additional costs, I've introduced an in-game currency called tokens. This approach was chosen to make the costs of operating the game transparent to players. Without the compromise of having tokens to offset these costs, the game would need to be priced higher than AAA titles to be commercially viable over the long-term.<br><br><strong>If you run out of tokens, you will automatically receive 10,000 tokens for free each day</strong>. If you wish to bypass the token system entirely, you can provide your own API keys, switch to free AI models in the settings, or install the AI models locally from the Steam Workshop.</i>",
